<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰλασσ-όω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰλασσ-ττόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make</i> or <i>changeinto
			sea</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠπείρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					400a27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νεῖλος θ. τὴν Αἴγυπτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purify with sea-water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς θαλαττοῦται</span> she
				<i>leaks</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.15.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of wine,
				<i>to be mixed with sea-water</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.7.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνοι τεθαλασσωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					1.32d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.247
			</span></i> (sg.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				468
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>to be a sea-faring man</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ner.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
